@startuml Agent Request Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 80

title Agent Request Processing Sequence

actor User as U
participant ChatUI as UI
participant AgentChatRequestApi as API
participant ChatAgentSessionEntity as Session
participant AgentLauncherApi as Launcher
participant AgentSession as AgSession
participant AgentFrontend as Frontend
participant LLMProvider as LLM

U -> UI: Enter request
UI -> API: sendRequest(request)
API -> Session: Get/Create session
Session -> Launcher: createSession(config)
Launcher -> AgSession: Start agent process
AgSession --> Launcher: Agent started

note right of Launcher
  AgentLauncherApi handles
  session lifecycle and
  RPC communication
end note

AgSession -> Frontend: buildArguments()
Frontend -> AgSession: Request preparation
AgSession -> LLM: API request
LLM -> Frontend: Stream response
Frontend -> AgSession: Response events
AgSession -> Launcher: Event stream
Launcher -> API: Event updates
API -> UI: Update UI

U -> UI: View response

note over Session,Frontend
  Session checks permissions
  and builds context before
  sending to LLM provider
end note

@enduml
